// HUNT ONLY. Not scored by SIM-EDR-027 and not satisfied by its telemetry: this chain opens no SSH session.
// This is not the built-in alert's logic, which its reference page does not publish. It lists SSH-client network rows on port 22.
// The network field names (action_remote_ip, action_remote_port, actor_process_command_line) follow this corpus's convention and have not been checked against Linux agent network rows in this lab.
dataset = xdr_data
| filter timestamp_diff(current_time(), _time, "SECOND") < 604800
| filter agent_os_type = ENUM.AGENT_OS_LINUX
| filter event_type = ENUM.NETWORK
| filter actor_process_image_name in ("ssh", "scp", "sftp") and action_remote_port = 22
| fields _time, agent_hostname, actor_causality_id, actor_process_image_name, actor_process_command_line, action_remote_ip, action_remote_port
